---
description: On-page SEO rules for tool and guide pages
globs: src/pages/**/*.astro,src/data/tools/**/*.ts
---
- One H1, unique title ≤60 chars, meta description 50–165 chars, self canonical.
- Primary keyword in title/H1; no duplicate intents (see docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md).
- Breadcrumbs + JSON-LD on every indexable page (CollectionPage on hubs + guides index).
- Origin from PUBLIC_SITE_URL / siteDefaults only — see docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md and docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md.
- Tool pages must link at least one topical guide; guides ≥800 words with FAQPage.
